: "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WA9mMjdVhLgu1P5MvhXukS", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54135, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WA9mMjdVhLgu1P5MvhXukS", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 56445, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01XqbSybuUGbJQE31wDh52wS", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 56745, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01XqbSybuUGbJQE31wDh52wS", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 56745, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XqbSybuUGbJQE31wDh52wS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60938, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. The two releases after it, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, were both marked unhealthy. My first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, so us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1 for a short time. I retried the same rollback and it finished in us-west and eu-west. All regions are now on v2.3.0. The service passes health checks and the error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is a SEV2 for checkout-api and covers the bad deploy, the rollback, the partial failure and the next steps. The request to create it timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. It had already been created, so I didn't send it again, which would have paged on-call a second time.\n\n**Next steps (also noted in the incident):** find out why v2.3.1 is failing and what caused the orchestrator error before anyone redeploys v2.3.x.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KqKQcUSeAjXhzzJN6U69Nc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Y8jKebk1Vmwaz5fqnJNw5X", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1; seq 2 and 3 are both unhealthy).", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RXhjdAM2gefCsg6WTDtx1u", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0181rP9HL48bFAqUCv6VWtBo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HQfM7NG7PWJoEsD3B7Po5G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Ec1Qn9y7Ap7dzbpCZ96g1t", "caller": {"type": "direct"